[ti:Phir Le Aya Dil (Reprise)]
[ar:Arijit Singh • Pritam]

[00:20.00]Phir le aaya dil majboor kya keeje,
[00:34.50]Raas na aaya rehna door kya keeje...
[00:46.50]Dil keh raha use maqammal kar bhi aao,
[00:54.50]Woh jo adhuri si baat baaki hai,
[01:01.50]Woh jo adhuri si yaad baaki hai,
[01:07.50]Woh jo adhuri si yaad baaki hai...
[01:19.50]Karte hain hum aaj qabool kya keeje,
[01:31.50]Ho gayi thi humse yeh bhool kya keeje...
[01:45.50]Dil keh raha use mayassar kar bhi aao,
[01:54.50]Woh jo dabi si aas baaki hai,
[02:06.50]Woh jo dabi si aanch baaki hai,
[02:14.50]Woh jo dabi si aanch baaki hai...
[02:50.50]Kismat ko hai manzoor kya keeje,
[03:10.50]Kismat ko hai manzoor kya keeje...
[03:34.50]Milte rahe hum badastoor kya keeje,
[03:46.50]Dil keh raha hai use musalsal kar bhi aao...
